{"id":"gobernador","lemma":"gobernador","pos":"adj","rank":1614,"glosses":["governing"],"ipa":"/ɡobeɾnaˈdoɾ/","forms":{"feminine":"gobernadora","masculinePlural":"gobernadores","femininePlural":"gobernadoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-gobernador.wav","examples":[{"text":"El gobernador estaba furioso.","en":"The governor was furious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639596","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"furious, raging"}]},{"text":"El gobernador abusó de su autoridad.","en":"The governor abused his authority.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to abuse, to betray","l":"abusar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"authority"}]},{"text":"En este país, cualquier tilingo es gobernador, diputado o senador.","en":"In this country, any fool can be a governor, a representative or a senator.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831479","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"country"},null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"deputy"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"senator"}]}]}